{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":23.6299991607666,"text":"On the same wall as the boxers stand antelopes, drawn with a few black lines on a pale background. There is no shading and no detail in the coat, and yet the animals look alive. The whole job is done by the curve of the neck and the tilt of the head. The strange part is that antelopes did not live on Santorini, so the painter had seen them somewhere else, or had heard them described.","words":[{"word":"On","start":0,"end":0.2800000011920929},{"word":"the","start":0.2800000011920929,"end":0.46000000834465027},{"word":"same","start":0.46000000834465027,"end":0.8199999928474426},{"word":"wall","start":0.8199999928474426,"end":1.0399999618530273},{"word":"as","start":1.0399999618530273,"end":1.2200000286102295},{"word":"the","start":1.2200000286102295,"end":1.3600000143051147},{"word":"boxers","start":1.3600000143051147,"end":1.899999976158142},{"word":"stand","start":1.899999976158142,"end":2.319999933242798},{"word":"antelopes","start":2.319999933242798,"end":2.880000114440918},{"word":"drawn","start":3.5999999046325684,"end":3.5999999046325684},{"word":"with","start":3.5999999046325684,"end":3.799999952316284},{"word":"a","start":3.799999952316284,"end":4.159999847412109},{"word":"few","start":4.159999847412109,"end":4.28000020980835},{"word":"black","start":4.28000020980835,"end":4.579999923706055},{"word":"lines","start":4.579999923706055,"end":4.920000076293945},{"word":"on","start":4.920000076293945,"end":5.179999828338623},{"word":"a","start":5.179999828338623,"end":5.480000019073486},{"word":"pale","start":5.480000019073486,"end":5.480000019073486},{"word":"background","start":5.480000019073486,"end":5.940000057220459},{"word":"There","start":6.619999885559082,"end":6.699999809265137},{"word":"is","start":6.699999809265137,"end":6.900000095367432},{"word":"no","start":6.900000095367432,"end":7.21999979019165},{"word":"shading","start":7.21999979019165,"end":7.460000038146973},{"word":